  "description": "To protect the fragile young lady of the house, a devoted maid offers herself in her place, becoming the outlet for the master's relentless desires. Bound by duty and hierarchy, she endures a cold arrangement where her role is clear and her feelings irrelevant. Yet beneath the harsh commands and forbidden intimacy, unspoken emotions begin to stir, turning a cruel obligation into a complicated bond neither of them expected.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/3498026399), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14143213)",
